    74	| Program | Eligible | Participants | Effective rate | Stored flag share among eligible | Dollars | Admin/Urban anchor |
    75	|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
    76	| SNAP (SPM units) | 23.91M | 21.81M (60.6M persons) | **91.2%** | 93.7% | $92.0B | FNS FY24: 22.5M avg-month hh, $93.9B; Urban rate 57.5% (people, avg month) |
