   308	| Early Head Start | (d); (a) UNKNOWN | Stored flag is all `True` and no target exists; every formula-eligible person passes the take-up flag gate. (`EVIDENCE:evidence/pinned_artifact_probe.txt:24-25`; `EVIDENCE:evidence/pinned_diagnostics_summary.txt:86`) |
