   146	## C. Current Populace build: take-up seeding
   147	
   148	### C.0 Version boundary
   149	
   150	This section describes current `origin/main` at `8828dee`, not the unknown historical Populace revision that built the June artifact. The current contract says it was generated against PolicyEngine US 1.752.2; the audited runtime is 1.779.4 and the pinned artifact was built with 1.729.0. (`POP@8828dee:packages/populace-build/src/populace/build/us/take_up_contract.json:1-15`; `EVIDENCE:evidence/source_identity.txt:1-17`)
   151	
   152	### C.1 Contract and rates
   153	
   154	The contract declares an engine-asserted set of 13 flags. All 13 have engine class `data_seeded`, which the contract defines as a bare input leaf—not a claim that Populace actually writes the column. Its separate `populace_treatment` field and dedicated-stage ownership determine the current build action. (`POP@8828dee:packages/populace-build/src/populace/build/us/take_up_contract.json:1-15,17-204`)
